==French==

===Etymology===
From *''postius'', a {{etyl|VL.|fr}} comparative of {{term|post|lang=la}}.<ref>{{cite book | last = Picoche | first = Jacqueline | coauthors = Jean-Claude Rolland | title = Dictionnaire étymologique du français | year = 2009 | publisher = Dictionnaires Le Robert | location = Paris | language = French | pages = | chapter = }}</ref> Compare Portuguese {{term|pois|lang=pt}}, Spanish {{term|pues|lang=es}}.

