===Verb===
{{fr-verb-form}}

# {{archaic|or|literary|lang=fr}} {{form of|First person indicative present|pouvoir}}
#: '''''Puis'''-je vous aider?'' - ''May I help you?''

====Usage notes====
Used only in the formal inverted question form (''puis-je'' "may I"). A common alternative is ''Est-ce que je peux'' or more simply in a colloquial context: ''Je peux'' or ''J'peux'' (pronunced /ʃpø/).

